ORIGIN - database
    collections:
        - projectName (collection that stores all project structure related documents)

        - projectName_workfiles (collection that contains all work_scenes)

        - projectName_publishes (collection that contains all publishes)

        - projectName_control (collection that contains all INCOMING and OUTGOING packages)

ORIGIN_GLOBALS - database
    collections:
    - configuration (collection that contains globals settings of the ORIGIN pipeline)
        -> connection URL to the MongoDB server

    - users

    - usage_reports

